        <sdp:imageCaption xml:lang="id">In 1933 Soekarno was arrested on charges of carrying out movements and gathering the natives to fight the Dutch, then exiled to Ende, East Nusa Tenggara. After being exiled to Ende</sdp:imageCaption>
